WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.480
 Answer this question: What
matters more to you than money?

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.570
Now ask yourself: Why?

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:10.530
Those are your values.

00:00:13.197 --> 00:00:14.290
Hey, everyone.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:16.410
I'm Elaine Welteroth, and
I'm the editor-in-chief

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:17.250
of "Teen Vogue."

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:21.990
I spent over a decade building
a career as a magazine editor.

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:25.020
It's really scary to
walk away from that.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:28.245
I looked up one day and
realized that I had more dreams.

00:00:32.259 --> 00:00:37.300
Gone are the days we work at one
company for our entire lives.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.210
It's about dreaming
out of the box

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:44.140
and designing a career path
that's as unique as you are.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:50.910
This MasterClass is for all
the creative entrepreneurs,

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.740
the multi-hyphenates,
which I like

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:55.620
to call "moguls in the
making", big dreamers who

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.840
just need a little bit
of help figuring out

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.420
how to map out
exactly how you're

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:02.610
going to make all of
your career dreams

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:04.688
happen in this one lifetime.

00:01:04.688 --> 00:01:07.230
We're going to talk about the
difference between good writing

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:10.920
and great writing, marketing
and social media, team building.

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.250
It takes a village, y'all.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.550
What is your zone of genius?

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:17.760
That sweet spot at
the intersection

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:22.020
of your passions, talents,
values, and your skills.

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:24.420
Understanding your
zone of genius

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:27.910
allows you to stay focused
on what matters the most.

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:30.030
It is never too late to pivot.

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:31.798
Fear is going to be
part of the process.

00:01:31.798 --> 00:01:33.840
You're thinking, "How am
I going to pay my bills?

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:35.400
What about health
insurance, girl?

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.210
I'm tired of ramen noodles."

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:38.040
I've been there.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.210
I completely get it.

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:41.550
We have to figure out
how to dance with fear

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:46.200
to be able to reinvent ourselves
and our careers time and time

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.990
again, and I want to
help you craft the plan

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:51.610
to make it happen.

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:56.820
I'm Elaine Welteroth, and
this is my MasterClass.

